    "duckdb_or_quack_state_written": false,
    "implementation_delta": "Publish CrossRepositoryCompatibility@1 as compact recipes. One explicit supported combination binds Accelerate, Datasets, and Kit to catalog CID baguqeeraqpptps2gf55wmthv3sm5nzlxqqdjfyg2ggkbl5ovfzuvvvsxap4a, PCPR-041 vector CIDs, and PCPR-042 negative document CID under Python 3.12. Missing-repository, reminted, sibling-import, cross-version, mixed-catalog, partial-publication, unsupported-Python, authority-boundary, and claimed-early combinations fail identically. Datasets and Kit bind the document CID and refuse remint without sibling import or re-encoding. This is not a freeze and not the signed PCPR-056 lock. Live supervisor and CUDA re-qualification stay typed unavailable. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
